classDiagram
 direction LR
 class RegistrationService {
  +registerSensor()
  +deregisterSensor()
  +registerAlert()
  +link()
  +unlink()
 }
 class DWSMonitor {
  +lastSeenBySensor
  +update()
  +checkSilence()
 }
 class Link {
  +sensorId
  +alertId
  +lower
  +width
  +outside() bool
 }
 class AlertGateway {
  +send()
  +warnManager()
 }
 class RecordStore {
  +append()
  +readAll()
 }
 RegistrationService --> DWSMonitor : attach / detach via SensorSubject
 RegistrationService --> Link
 RegistrationService --> RecordStore
 DWSMonitor --> Link
 DWSMonitor --> AlertGateway
 DWSMonitor --> RecordStore
